\ crypto/dilithium.fam — Dilithium (ML-DSA-65, FIPS 204), as tabminer's
\ miner/src/mldsa.rs: the same parameters and encodings, so a key, a
\ signature and a verdict here are tabminer's (crypto/dilithium_test.fam,
\ with miner/src/fam_dilithium_vectors.rs's values).  The wallet's
\ long-lived key (docs/GUI_WALLET.md).  After crypto/keccak.fam.
\
\ Keys: public 1,952 bytes (7A0), secret 4,032 (FC0), signatures 3,309
\ (CED).  Key generation is deterministic from a 32-byte seed; signing is
\ too (FIPS 204's zero randomness, tabminer's sign, not hedged), over a
\ message with a context of at most 255 bytes.
\
\ dilkey ( seed pk sk -- )  the key pair of the 32 bytes at seed.
\ dilsign ( sk msg mlen ctx clen sig -- )  the signature, at sig.
\ dilver ( pk msg mlen ctx clen sig -- flag )  whether it is pk's.
\
\ A polynomial is 256 words, each below q (8,380,417), as tabminer's
\ arrays after modq.  RV32I has no multiply: a product mod q is three
\ rows of byte products from a table (128 KiB, dlmtab) and three
\ reductions (2^23 = 2^13 - 1 mod q), in the raw words, which do the
\ NTT, its inverse and the products a polynomial at a time.

: dlmt variable ;  : dlzt variable ;  : dlpb variable ;
: dla variable ;  : dls1 variable ;  : dls2 variable ;  : dlt0 variable ;  : dly variable ;  : dlyh variable ;
: dlw variable ;  : dlz variable ;  : dlc variable ;  : dlch variable ;  : dltp variable ;  : dlh variable ;
: dlct0 variable ;  : dlwc variable ;
: dlin variable ;  : dlrho variable ;  : dlrp variable ;  : dlkk variable ;  : dltr variable ;  : dlmu variable ;
: dlr2 variable ;  : dlct variable ;  : dlxb variable ;  : dlbf variable ;  : dlb2 variable ;  : dlz32 variable ;
: dlpk variable ;  : dlsk variable ;  : dlsg variable ;  : dlmsg variable ;  : dlml variable ;  : dlctx variable ;
: dlcl variable ;  : dlpp variable ;  : dlkap variable ;  : dlzn variable ;  : dlr0 variable ;  : dlcn variable ;
: dlwt variable ;  : dlo variable ;  : dlres variable ;  : dlhs variable ;  : dlhx variable ;  : dlhe variable ;
: dlhf variable ;  : dlok variable ;  : dlrd variable ;  : dlrj variable ;  : dlmi variable ;  : dlmd variable ;
: dlmvv variable ;  : dlua variable ;  : dlun variable ;  : dlub variable ;  : dlubt variable ;  : dlus variable ;
: dlupp variable ;

\ The raw words, from tools/gendilithium.py through tools/asm2fam.py.
\ dlmtab ( tbl -- )  the byte products: the halfword at tbl + 2(256a + b)
\ is a*b.
